# Local env files
# Every .env variant is secret except the committed template. A narrow list
# missed .env.test (which holds DB_PASSWORD, JWT_SECRET and COOKIE_SECRET) and
# would also miss any ad-hoc .env.bak or .env.old left behind, so the glob is
# deliberately broad.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.template

# Turbo
.turbo
.vscode

# vercel
.vercel

